(HengSeng Sentiment Price Prediction Agent is an end-to-end, multi-agent financial intelligence and short-horizon forecasting) Tj
T* (platform covering 10 major equities across the Hong Kong Stock Exchange \(HKEX\) and Korea Exchange \(KRX\). The system) Tj
T* (collects social forum posts and financial news in English, Traditional Chinese, and Korean, scores multilingual sentiment with) Tj
T* (engagement weighting, aligns every signal strictly to exchange closing cutoffs to prevent look-ahead leakage, and forecasts) Tj
T* (next-trading-day \(n+1\) closing prices with conformal uncertainty intervals.) Tj
