(1. Social Anti-Bot Restrictions: Platforms enforcing Cloudflare Turnstile or strict actor permissions \(e.g., LIHKG\) are never) Tj
T* (bypassed; when live posts are unavailable, labeled SIMULATED DEMO DATA is isolated from ML training.) Tj
T* (2. Runtime NLP Tier: In containers without PyTorch/transformers, sentiment runs our trained TF-IDF + Logistic Regression) Tj
T* (hybrid model with lexicon fallback.) Tj
T* (3. Short-Horizon Noise: Large-cap 1-day equity returns have low signal-to-noise ratio; strong regularization \(Ridge alpha=30,) Tj
T* (shallow trees\) and conformal bands prevent overconfident point forecasts.) Tj
